# Accumula Town (houses climbing a hill, a square where people stop to listen): an oboe tune in F major over strings,
# plucked strings stepping up the slope, a walking bass and a gentle beat. At night a clarinet takes the tune.
# Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U10).
